  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds .NET 8, .NET 9, and .NET 10 multi-target support, dynamic ASP.NET Core policy names, authorization-service extensions, fallback-compatible policy resolution, and fail-closed resource-type enforcement. Adds Minimal API endpoint authorization, controller/action authorization attributes, route-value resource mapping, and live HTTP pipeline verification. Adds strict scalar subject, resource, and context attribute comparisons with fail-closed type handling. Adds YAML manifest syntax, validation, and compilation for typed subject, resource, and context attribute requirements. Adds opt-in authorization diagnostics with nested requirement traces, timing, safe failure metadata, and ASP.NET Core structured logging.",
